# S3a.3 neutral landscape corpus v1. Metres, RH Z-up; NOT a native capture.
# case name area inside_area min_crossings refinement_max_area
# points N local xyz; constraints N (role count indices); line N local xyz; end
# Survey origin is added in both languages. No random generator or inferred IDs.
case wall_sides 400 36 0 0
points 9
0 0 0 20 0 3 20 20 3 0 20 0
6 0 0 6 20 0 6.2 0 3 6.2 20 3
18 10 3
constraints 3
1 4 0 1 2 3
3 2 4 5
3 2 6 7
line 4
4 4 0 10 4 0 10 10 0 4 10 0
end

